      "comment": "PARIAH FLYER (5) was doing her best work late last start to get up for second over 1175m at Albury. Can settle closer from the inside draw and is expected to be there at the business end. LET UP (7) showed good early dash and stalked the pace last start before drawing clear to score over 1200m at Bathurst on debut. Can figure in the finish again. XERXES (2) wasn't far away sticking on gamely into fifth first-up at the Sapphire Coast. Is sure to have come on from that and looks capable of taking this out. SEASMOKE (6)  is second-up after a fine return last start, finishing just 0.6 L off the winner over 1200m at Narrandera. Is another likely improver that gets a good chance to salute.",
